# Example .mgrepignore file
# Uses gitignore syntax

# Project-specific exclusions
internal-tools/
legacy-code/
*.proprietary

# Keep specific generated files
!dist/bundle.js  # Keep this generated file
!*.d.ts          # Keep TypeScript definitions

# Override default behavior (examples of using negation)
# These patterns override the default ignore patterns
!test/coverage/    # Keep test coverage reports
!docs/*.md          # Keep documentation files
